# AGENTS.md (example snippet)

## Agent Annotations
- UI annotations may exist under `.agent-annotations/`.
- Before making UI changes, you MAY check open annotations if the user asks, or if it is clearly relevant.
- After implementing a fix, mark related annotations `resolved`.

## Browser validation (only if user requests it)
If the user explicitly asks to validate in a browser and a browser automation tool is available (browser skill, MCP tool, Playwright, etc.):
- open the annotated URL
- locate the element using `data-testid` / role / text hints
- capture before/after screenshots

## Local receiver (run by the user)
- The receiver is a user-run process. Do NOT start long-running servers unless asked.
- Run from repo root:
  - `node .tools/agent-annotations-receiver.cjs --port 8787`
  - or `pnpm dlx agent-annotations-receiver --port 8787`
